config U30PRO_SPRD_SCUFREQ
 tristate "Unisoc software SCU (DSU) frequency scaling"
 depends on U30PRO_SPRD_CPUFREQ_V2 && U30PRO_SPRD_PMU_SAMPLE
 help
   Chooses the frequency of the snoop control unit (DSU) from the PMU samples of the CPUs (load and memory access demand) instead of the
   firmware's autotune.  Only active with u30pro_scufreq=1 on the kernel command line (see drivers/unisoc_platform/scufreq).
